 As a rat, you have to use your tiny rat brain to think outside the box. Slink through the shadows, outsmart the traps, and use your power to navigate through this murky place.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Allies</strong> - Every rat knows that surviving without the help of your own kind is never easy, especially when everyone sees you as an outsider. To find your way home, it might be wiser to be accepted by them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense Encounters</strong> - Most tenants don\u2019t enjoy surprise visits from furry strangers. If they spot you, they\u2019ll panic. Or worse. Stay quiet, stay hidden, and prepare for a hasty retreat when things get loud.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Strange Little Story</strong> - Curiosity leads the way, and nothing is quite as it seems. When the lights go out, be cautious of the strange things hidden beneath the charm, still waiting to be uncovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742840/extras/21806928349b91295c20408b746f5f02.poster.avif?t=1756524788\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742840/extras/21806928349b91295c20408b746f5f02.webm?t=1756524788\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Eclair Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3742840/5dfe6e42eb26ae050ccfa5220dd4dd9fdb0d459d/hea